WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.315
BigMo builds AI products for people who can't afford an AI that guesses.

00:00:05.315 --> 00:00:11.370
LakshyaPrep: AI scans and plans your SAT, ACT or MCAT route. A one-to-one coach leads.

00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:15.574
AI MarketPulse: the AI interprets the market. Deterministic code decides.

00:00:15.574 --> 00:00:20.519
DesiSquare: desi investors abroad answer each other, ranked by helpfulness, never money.

00:00:20.519 --> 00:00:25.463
EOT-PCS: AI flags the export paperwork. A maker and a checker approve.

00:00:25.463 --> 00:00:30.037
Swaad: an AI copilot briefs the shop floor. The staff decide.

00:00:30.037 --> 00:00:34.241
KPMRentals: AI triages and prices the repair. The owner approves.

00:00:34.241 --> 00:00:37.441
Ledger Book: AI proposes. The ledger disposes.

00:00:37.441 --> 00:00:42.385
Seven products. One rule. AI does the work. People make the call.

00:00:42.385 --> 00:00:46.248
Get the Big Mo, at bigmoda dot ai.
